*J_NAME		"Adventurer Skadi"

*J_CHAT		"Hello! I'm Scady who has traveled all over the Priston continent." 
*J_CHAT		"I was born from a traveler family with a twin. I'm doing volunteer work at the village during this dangerous time."
*J_CHAT		"Could you please say 'Hello' to my younger brother? ^0^"